</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Snapper is a melee combatant so chases its opponent, but runs in very low health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKill it like a normal <a href=\"#/wiki/Crocodile\">Crocodile</a>.<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> and Mages: There is a big rock in the middle they can run around and shoot at him from.<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>: If your level is lower than 20, bring potions because he has a high defense and you won't hit too much.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"fa3da1acd51bab096bfffe7163482196\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:122px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:107px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-The_Snapper-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:88px; width:120px; top:8.5px;\"><img alt=\"The Snapper being killed\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The Snapper being killed\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Snapper_a340cd.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"The Snapper.jpg (58 KB)\" width=\"120\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:120px;\">The Snapper being killed</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:122px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:107px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-The_Snapper_room-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:105px; width:120px;\"><img alt=\"The Snapper's entire room\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The Snapper's entire room\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Snapper_ro